{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/2186","id":4960532208,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAivEQM8AAAABJ6u28A","html_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2186","diff_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2186.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/osfans/trime/pull/2186.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/issues/2186","number":2186,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(jni): handle standard UTF-8 and UTF-16 positions","user":{"login":"X2M7","id":239118790,"node_id":"U_kgDODkCpxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239118790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7","html_url":"https://github.com/X2M7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Rime supplies standard UTF-8, while JNI `NewStringUTF` expects Modified UTF-8. The stock `a` candidate `𠼞` can therefore abort CheckJNI. Convert strings explicitly at the UTF-8/UTF-16 boundary and use UTF-16 code units for composition positions.\n\nFollowing the review feedback, `2ad1865f` removes checks after non-throwing length queries and the duplicate check after a failed key description. Valid UTF-8 is converted directly once; only malformed input enters replacement handling, with partial output cleared before retry. Checks that stop Rime/OpenCC side effects after a failed conversion, release acquired characters, or preserve an existing JNI exception remain.\n\nValidation for this revision:\n\n- 115 real checked-JVM Unicode assertions and 46 UTF-16 position assertions pass. Both upstream controls compile and fail at their expected supplementary-character assertions.\n- All six JNI translation units compile for NDK28/API21 x86_64 with `-Wall -Wextra -Werror` and the existing unused-parameter exclusion; diagnostic logs are empty.\n- [Current upstream PR CI](https://github.com/osfans/trime/actions/runs/39897889043): 5/5 jobs passed; application unit-test and Lint tasks executed. Its recorded upstream merge is qualified separately from the fork head; no new full-application testcase count is inferred.\n\n[Source, original streams and scope](https://github.com/X2M7/trime/blob/599b26cfbbec22f753ce421fe1d7abf895cf7d00/doc/contribution-split/checks/review-slim-20261023/README.md) are outside the patch. This revision has no new Android runtime acceptance. Earlier CheckJNI smoke evidence remains historical; the API21 candidate-rendering gap was separate and whole-app/display/Release acceptance is not claimed.\n\nThe native CI build retains warnings from pinned yaml-cpp, librime-lua and LevelDB dependencies; those libraries are unchanged by this PR.\n","created_at":"2026-10-22T01:09:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:46:02Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"009a6e643ead0da836102df02370ed5901c938d2","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/2186/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/2186/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/issues/2186/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/osfans/trime/statuses/2ad1865fd97f09ffba231e5c0e23092cd383b059","head":{"label":"X2M7:contrib/pr-jni-unicode-transport","ref":"contrib/pr-jni-unicode-transport","sha":"2ad1865fd97f09ffba231e5c0e23092cd383b059","user":{"login":"X2M7","id":239118790,"node_id":"U_kgDODkCpxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239118790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7","html_url":"https://github.com/X2M7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1252010092,"node_id":"R_kgDOSqAobA","name":"trime","full_name":"X2M7/trime","private":false,"owner":{"login":"X2M7","id":239118790,"node_id":"U_kgDODkCpxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239118790?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7","html_url":"https://github.com/X2M7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/X2M7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https:/